USRobotics Courier HST Telix TLX_HST Script, Production Release 2.1
-------------------------------------------------------------------

    (C) Copyright Andrzej Taramina 1988, 1989, 1990

Release History, New Features and Planned Enhancements


3.0 Planned Enhancements:

    - Full support of all HST/DS/144x features and commands
    - Support of Monochrome and CGA monitors.
    - Whatever anyone else suggests that I have time for!

2.1 - Minor bug fix: &K0 not set properly with ROM level 964 modem

2.0 - New popup colour menus with arrow-key and mouse support for
      selection of options.
    - A more logical grouping of functions into separate popup menus
    - Verification of PCBoard settings to be consistent with Clark
      Development's PCBModem routine's settings.
    - Faster display of all prompts and messages
    - More Dual-Standard and 1440 feature support
    - Improved documentation and DS/1440 inclusion
    - Automatic setting of Telix Modem configuration strings for
      optimal transmissions
    - Minor and obscure bug fixes

1.2 - Interim release to allow TLX_HST to run with the new HST 1441
      Rom Level modems.
    - Minor bug fixes

1.1 - Interim release to allow TLX_HST to run with the new HST 1440
      modems.  All of the new features of the 1440 are not supported
      at this time but are planned for future releases. This release
      has not been tested with a 1440 as I don't (yet) have one.
    - Various obscure bugs fixed
    - Cosmetic fixes were made to insure consistency.
    - Changes were made by USR within ROM level 964.  Early 964
      upgrades did not document certain 964 features, and these were
      not implemented in release 1.8.  All known 964 features
      (specifically, s-register 15 settings) are in release 1.1
    - The word "abort" was changed throughout the script to the word
      "cancel" or "terminate".
    - Addition to S15 settings mentioned earlier in the fix section.
    - Addition of S13 register settings as option 21 of main menu.

1.0 - First release of the TLX_HST modem setup script for Telix

Andrzej Taramina
01/23/89
